cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these datasets, please cite them as below."
type: dataset
title: "Nexus Prism public datasets: sanctions, export control, structural CoinJoin detection, and dark-web infrastructure"
abstract: >-
  Six spreadsheet workbooks built from public-domain government records, from a
  Bitcoin archival node operated by the author, and from first-party dark-web
  infrastructure measurements. Every summary figure is a live spreadsheet
  formula referencing the raw rows it derives from, so any published number can
  be traced rather than taken on trust. Includes a documented defect in the
  author's own CoinJoin detector and the filtered subset that corrects for it.
authors:
